<title>UK: GZB-Bank sets 200 mln mark Rex-linked 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>GZB-Bank sets 200 mln mark Rex-linked 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GZB-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *6.0	 MATURITY    25.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE    REX-LINKED   ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    STUTT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN 81 PCT OF REX 10-YEAR YIELD</p>
<p>		INDEX THEREAFTER. (30/360 DAY BASIS)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
